"표지 재포획법으로 개체 수 세기":["Counting individuals by mark and recapture","Contar individuos por captura y recaptura","Compter les individus par capture-marquage-recapture","Individuen zählen mit Fang und Wiederfang","標識再捕獲法で個体数を数える"],
